Designed for iPad.\nNot verified for macOS.","tertiaryTitleAction":null,"tertiaryTitleArtwork":null,"developerTagline":"Mobile DWG Solution","ageRating":"00+","productDescription":"VinaCAD — A DWG solution made for Vietnamese engineers and architects.\nVinaCAD is a free DWG application developed by the team at Prima Solutions / TGL Solutions, allowing you to view, manage, and share technical drawings anytime, anywhere. The app supports smooth opening of DWG, DXF, IFC, and STEP file formats. It also provides architectural tools for section cuts, area display, and detail export. The interface is intuitive and optimized for both smartphones and tablets.\nVinaCAD is 100% licensed and proudly developed in Vietnam, tailored to meet the needs of Vietnamese users. It is continuously updated with new features optimized for the construction and design industries.\nTo get started, simply log in to your account, upload your DWG drawings, and view or edit your files.\nExperience VinaCAD and make your design and drawing management faster, simpler, and more professional.","rating":3,"ratingCount":"13","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=6753970013&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=borat_vnd&appExtVrsId=890282862"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"6753970013"},{"locationPosition":1,"locationType":"lockup","name":"VinaCAD - View & Edit DWG","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"6753970013"},{"locationPosition":7,"locationType":"similarItems","name":"You Might Also Like","idType":"relationship","id":"customers-also-bought-apps"}],"jet_adamId":"6753970013","eventType":"click","targetType":"button","targetId":"6753970013","