remote areas with no internet access.\n• Custom Units: Supports acres, hectares, square feet, square meters, and other units for versatile use.\n• Satellite & Hybrid Map Views: Toggle between different map types to visualize the land better while surveying or planning.\n• Easy Point Editing: Add, delete, or adjust measurement points with simple gestures—no tech skills needed.\n• Save & Export Results: Save measurements and share them as images or reports via email or messaging apps.\n• Live Location Tracking: Track your path live while moving to measure large or irregular areas more accurately.\n\nWhether you're a farmer checking crop acreage, a real estate agent marking property boundaries, a civil engineer planning construction layouts, or an outdoor adventurer mapping your route—this GPS area calculator gives you precision, convenience, and peace of mind. Designed for professionals and hobbyists alike, it puts powerful land measurement tools in your pocket.\n\nDownload GPS Field Area Measurement today and turn your iPhone into a smart land surveyor. Measure fields, plots, or trails with GPS precision—anytime, anywhere.","rating":4.8,"ratingCount":"143","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=6738375837&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=borat_vnd&appExtVrsId=889006861"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"6738375837"},{"locationPosition":9,"locationType":"lockup","name":"GPS Field Area Measure & Map","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"6738375837"},{"locationPosition":7,"locationType":"similarItems","name":"You Might Also Like","idType":"relationship","id":"customers-also-bought-apps"}],"jet_adamId":"673837